{
  "name": "future",
  "class": "события из будущего",
  "description": "Событие с днём > now принимается и хранится, но не попадает в признаки, пока now не до него доберётся. Заодно: пустой customer_id (unattributed) и непокупочная строка с quantity=0 (в агрегаты не входит) (§4, §6, §7).",
  "question": "Почему r-fut-1 возвращает no_history, хотя событие клиента B уже принято и лежит в состоянии? Что изменится после продвижения now на 2011-02-20?",
  "input": {
    "observed_from": "2011-01-01",
    "observed_until": "2011-04-01",
    "reference_until": "2011-03-01"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "activate",
      "model_name": "hw4-logistic",
      "model_version": "1",
      "activation_id": "scen-future-1"
    },
    {
      "op": "time",
      "now": "2011-01-12",
      "closed_until": "2011-01-01"
    },
    {
      "op": "event",
      "payload": {
        "event_id": "e-400",
        "invoice_id": "I800",
        "stock_code": "S8",
        "description": "item",
        "quantity": 1,
        "invoice_at": "2011-02-15T10:00:00",
        "unit_price": "20.000000",
        "customer_id": "B",
        "country": "GB"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "wait_boundary"
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_status",
      "field": "attributed_new",
      "value": 1
    },
    {
      "op": "request",
      "payload": {
        "request_id": "r-fut-1",
        "client_id": "B",
        "as_of": "2011-01-12"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "wait_boundary"
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_prediction",
      "request_id": "r-fut-1",
      "status": "no_history",
      "features": null,
      "model_name": null,
      "model_version": null,
      "probability": null
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "Пустой customer_id: событие принимается, но клиенту не приписывается."
    },
    {
      "op": "event",
      "payload": {
        "event_id": "e-401",
        "invoice_id": "I801",
        "stock_code": "S8",
        "description": "item",
        "quantity": 1,
        "invoice_at": "2011-02-16T10:00:00",
        "unit_price": "5.000000",
        "customer_id": "",
        "country": "GB"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "Нулевое количество: не покупка и не отмена, в агрегаты не входит."
    },
    {
      "op": "event",
      "payload": {
        "event_id": "e-402",
        "invoice_id": "I802",
        "stock_code": "S8",
        "description": "item",
        "quantity": 0,
        "invoice_at": "2011-02-16T10:00:00",
        "unit_price": "5.000000",
        "customer_id": "B",
        "country": "GB"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "wait_boundary"
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_status",
      "field": "unattributed",
      "value": 1
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_status",
      "field": "attributed_new",
      "value": 2
    },
    {
      "op": "time",
      "now": "2011-02-20",
      "closed_until": "2011-01-01"
    },
    {
      "op": "request",
      "payload": {
        "request_id": "r-fut-2",
